{"3387240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Fairy Princess", "steam_appid": 3387240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/bc8c38e2ef500653a87fd36c07d217a4.avif?t=1787191069\" width=600 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of My Fairy Princess takes place in a fabled realm of peace and tranquility, where humans, fiends, and immortals coexist. Here, you will take on the role of a parent, leading your daughter through life and land alike. Traverse picturesque vistas of shimmering lakes and mountains, or wander bustling urban market towns. Every choice you make is a foreshadowing of fate itself. Will you guide her toward a quiet mortal life, or the path of transcendence beyond the mortal world? Your daughter's journey of growth is yours to write.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/7d8641de0698015d8158f0235d262a0c.avif?t=1787191069\" width=516 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to boring stat grinding. Your daughter's growth is shaped not only by planned activities, but by everything she does in daily life, from farming and cooking to fishing by the river or crafting elixirs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/9d0fce41a455c3ed49e7c246b8dd657a.poster.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/9d0fce41a455c3ed49e7c246b8dd657a.webm?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/9d0fce41a455c3ed49e7c246b8dd657a.mp4?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/2e90a5dba5f07cbb21300f96202077fa.poster.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/2e90a5dba5f07cbb21300f96202077fa.webm?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/2e90a5dba5f07cbb21300f96202077fa.mp4?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your philosophy of upbringing, her daily life will steadily lead her toward the future you envision for her.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/a729f1bd06f0dc0152a6e99b912c127a.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/0ee5cc42f1105ab1b08f8aa1da17a0a4.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/aacbd2c04c9a549bead9c203845c2f7f.avif?t=1787191069\" width=516 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though not the largest, Fairyland is home to dozens of unique characters, including an extravagant heiress with deep pockets, a wandering swordsman with no care in the world, and a devoted seeker of the Dao. These are no mere passing figures in your daughter's journey through life, but companions whose bonds will shape her emotional fate and future path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/8d3a2cb7b8e39e3faa2a50a96c1f402f.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/5b39446953b0b5c6dd25e51fbde53c85.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/965faef031d8ccf8dbdbdb86adc994db.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/516972210f2d28debe254039e0294dfb.avif?t=1787191069\" width=516 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every word and action you take becomes a guiding force in your daughter's fate. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/8cb29e1f36f9424cf9fd3a4adc638574.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She may become a renowned healer who mends the sick, a bewitching enchantress who steals hearts, a righteous prodigy devoted to justice, or a wandering hero of great prowess... Guide her onward, and discover countless endings and hidden paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/1cefcced314ff1cb41420930ee3d47bb.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/aea4ba610c92d34916cc30830df8950d.avif?t=1787191069\" width=516 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairyland is alive with shifting seasons, each offering its own charm and scenery. A casual stroll through bustling market streets might lead you into unexpected side stories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/f52f8e95d6697bd01010de022ce412b8.poster.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/f52f8e95d6697bd01010de022ce412b8.webm?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/f52f8e95d6697bd01010de022ce412b8.mp4?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond its borders lies a vast and perilous world, with wild regions of striking variety and a wealth of combat styles to master as you explore the unknown. And when trouble finds you? There's always the option to draw your divine weapon and &quot;reason&quot; with them, instead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/61cf2a037da7ae3634b74763e5f8a4cc.poster.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/61cf2a037da7ae3634b74763e5f8a4cc.webm?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/61cf2a037da7ae3634b74763e5f8a4cc.mp4?t=1787191069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/4e5e8cba3afc10c62eab4a06a480b267.avif?t=1787191069\" width=516 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While most leave life with at least some regrets, each new cycle brings new possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every playthrough, hidden storylines, special characters, and mysterious endings are gradually unlocked. A chance encounter in one life may become a legend in the next.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/acf02d11d22999c982eabca065730dff.avif?t=1787191069\" width=1402 height=788 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387240/extras/bc8c38e2ef500653a87fd36c07d217a4.avif?t=1787191069\" width=600 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of My Fairy Princess takes place in a fabled realm of peace and tranquility, where humans, fiends, and immortals coexist. Here, you will take on the role of a parent, leading your daughter through life and land alike. Traverse picturesque vistas of shimmering lakes and mountains, or wander bustling urban market towns. Every choice you make is a foreshadowing of fate itself. Will you guide her toward a quiet mortal life, or the path of transcendence beyond the mortal world? Your daughter's journey of growth is yours to write.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><spa